  "description": "Test helpers for PostQuantum.SecureChannel. Provides PqInMemoryDuplex.CreatePair() for a pair of in-memory Streams (no TCP, no sockets, no port allocation) and PqHandshakeHarness.Create() that returns a connected client+server PqSession pair in one call (with opt-in mutual auth, resumption secret, and session presets). Intended for test projects; not for production code paths.",
